<===> README.md
# At-rules nested in keyframes (and vice versa)

Like dart-sass, an unknown at-rule within `@keyframes` is still in the keyframes
(and `@keyframes` within an unknown at-rule is still in the unknown at-rule).
<===>
================================================================================
<===> keyframes_in_unknown/block/input.scss
@foo {@keyframes k {@bar {50% {a: b}}}}
<===> keyframes_in_unknown/block/output.css
@foo {
  @keyframes k {
    @bar {
      50% {
        a: b;
      }
    }
  }
}
<===>
================================================================================
<===> keyframes_in_unknown/declaration/input.scss
@foo {@keyframes k {a: b}}
<===> keyframes_in_unknown/declaration/output.css
@foo {
  @keyframes k {
    a: b;
  }
}
<===>
================================================================================
<===> keyframes_in_unknown/style_rule/input.scss
x {@foo {@keyframes k {50% {a: b}}}}
<===> keyframes_in_unknown/style_rule/output.css
@foo {
  @keyframes k {
    50% {
      a: b;
    }
  }
}
<===>
================================================================================
<===> unknown_in_keyframes/declaration/input.scss
@keyframes k {@foo {a: b}}
<===> unknown_in_keyframes/declaration/output.css
@keyframes k {
  @foo {
    a: b;
  }
}
<===>
================================================================================
<===> unknown_in_keyframes/from/input.scss
@keyframes k {@foo {from {a: b}}}
<===> unknown_in_keyframes/from/output.css
@keyframes k {
  @foo {
    from {
      a: b;
    }
  }
}
<===>
================================================================================
<===> unknown_in_keyframes/list/input.scss
@keyframes k {@foo {0%, 100% {a: b}}}
<===> unknown_in_keyframes/list/output.css
@keyframes k {
  @foo {
    0%, 100% {
      a: b;
    }
  }
}
<===>
================================================================================
<===> unknown_in_keyframes/nested/input.scss
@keyframes k {@foo {@bar {50% {a: b}}}}
<===> unknown_in_keyframes/nested/output.css
@keyframes k {
  @foo {
    @bar {
      50% {
        a: b;
      }
    }
  }
}
<===>
================================================================================
<===> unknown_in_keyframes/percentage/input.scss
@keyframes k {@foo {50% {a: b}}}
<===> unknown_in_keyframes/percentage/output.css
@keyframes k {
  @foo {
    50% {
      a: b;
    }
  }
}
<===>
================================================================================
<===> unknown_in_keyframes/vendor/input.scss
@-webkit-keyframes k {@foo {50% {a: b}}}
<===> unknown_in_keyframes/vendor/output.css
@-webkit-keyframes k {
  @foo {
    50% {
      a: b;
    }
  }
}
